+//          MP1 flag UNKNOWN addresses (not our MPU/baro/mag) worth adding
+//          support for. Scanned once at boot, rebroadcast at 0.2 Hz.
+//   20504  AK8975 mag (the 9150's own compass, via I2C bypass at 0x0C):
+//          int16[3] LE, ASA-adjusted counts (0.3 uT/LSB) + ST2 byte
+//          (bit3 = overflow). Device frame - MP1 owns interpretation.
+//   20510  STREAM CONTROL (MP1 -> node): u16 imu rate Hz + u8 AK rate Hz.
+//          DEADMAN: the IMU and AK streams run ONLY while these arrive
+//          fresh (<5 s old). A rebooted node is silent until the MP1
+//          firmware asks - so a reboot ALWAYS leaves a flash-quiet bus.
