+# THE 458 Hz mystery: AP's ChibiOS HAL clamps every I2C bus to 100 kHz by
+# default (HAL_I2C_MAX_CLOCK in I2CDevice.cpp) - a 14-byte MPU burst was
+# 1.7 ms of wire no matter what bus_clock the device requested. All parts
+# on this bus are 400 kHz capable (MPU-9150, BMP388, IST8310, QMC5883P).
+define HAL_I2C_MAX_CLOCK 400000
